{"unit_id":"Willmylife__dsh-model-connection-test#card-zh","repo":"Willmylife/dsh-model-connection-test","commit":"0d7f4608d22fbca26e3efc14669f70eda0664339","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Model Connection Test 是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型连通性插件，会在“设置 → 模型”页面加入测试面板。它读取当前可路由的提供商与模型目录，可逐个测试、测试一个提供商分组或批量测试全部模型。探测通过 DSH 宿主的 LLM 流式服务发送最小对话请求，并显示连接状态、失败代码、首个输出耗时和总耗时。遇到可重试的瞬时故障时会进行有限次数重试，适合在配置模型后快速确认其是否能正常响应。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:289-380","client.js:410-415","index.js:185-295"]}
{"unit_id":"Willmylife__dsh-model-connection-test#card-en","repo":"Willmylife/dsh-model-connection-test","commit":"0d7f4608d22fbca26e3efc14669f70eda0664339","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Model Connection Test adds a panel to DSH Web’s Settings → Models page. It reads routable models and lets users test one model, a provider group, or the full catalog. Probes use the host LLM stream and show status and latency; transient failures receive bounded retries.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:289-380","client.js:410-415","index.js:185-295"]}
