{"unit_id":"Willmylife__dsh-model-connection-test#feature-1","repo":"Willmylife/dsh-model-connection-test","commit":"0d7f4608d22fbca26e3efc14669f70eda0664339","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Model Connection Test 的功能「逐个探测模型」：在模型列表中点选某一行的测试按钮，插件会向宿主发送该提供商和模型的最小对话请求，并显示连接结果、失败信息及延迟。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:249-264","client.js:336-380"]}
