{"unit_id":"Willmylife__dsh-model-connection-test#feature-4","repo":"Willmylife/dsh-model-connection-test","commit":"0d7f4608d22fbca26e3efc14669f70eda0664339","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Model Connection Test 的功能「瞬时故障重试」：宿主对限流、服务器或传输等可重试故障进行有限次数的再次探测，并为最终结果标注尝试次数及是否属于瞬时问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:271-295"]}
{"unit_id":"Willmylife__dsh-model-connection-test#caveat-1","repo":"Willmylife/dsh-model-connection-test","commit":"0d7f4608d22fbca26e3efc14669f70eda0664339","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Model Connection Test 会通过 DSH 宿主的 LLM 服务向所选提供商发送测试对话；请求会到达该模型服务，具体服务由当前模型配置决定。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:185-203","index.js:302-304"]}
